---
import BaseLayout from './../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const pageHtml = "<div class=\"sd\">\n<section class=\"sd__hero shell\">\n  <span class=\"sd__kick reveal\"><i></i>Services</span>\n  <h1 class=\"sd__h1 reveal\">UX/UI <span style=\"color:#ffd200\">design.</span></h1>\n  <p class=\"sd__lead reveal\" data-d=\"1\"><b>An interface should guide the user</b>, not make them guess.</p>\n  <p class=\"sd__lead reveal\" data-d=\"1\">We design websites, online stores, apps and digital products – from user journeys and information architecture, through prototypes, to a design system ready for development.</p>\n  <div class=\"sd__facts reveal\" data-d=\"2\">\n    <div class=\"sd__fact\"><span>Scope</span><strong>Web · store · apps</strong></div>\n    <div class=\"sd__fact\"><span>Design</span><strong>UX · UI · prototype</strong></div>\n    <div class=\"sd__fact\"><span>Tools</span><strong>Figma · Adobe CC</strong></div>\n    <div class=\"sd__fact\"><span>Output</span><strong>Design system and prototype</strong></div>\n  </div>\n  <figure class=\"sd__reel reveal\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0\" data-d=\"1\">\n    <img style=\"object-fit:contain\" src=\"/assets/img/uslugi/ux-ui-soho-form.webp\" alt=\"Soho Form – website design\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" />\n    <figcaption><b>Soho Form</b><span>Website design</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</section>\n<div class=\"sd__body shell\">\n  <div>\n    <section class=\"sd__blk sd__split\" id=\"sd-overview\">\n      <div class=\"sd__splitL\"><div class=\"sd__blkh reveal\"><span class=\"sd__kick\"><i></i>Overview</span></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sd__splitR\">\n      <h3 class=\"fmt-lead reveal\">Good design is not pretty screens – it is the right decisions.</h3>\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">What the user sees first, where they click and what they do next decides whether a site sells or just looks nice. That is why we start with the business goal and the people who will actually use the product.</p>\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">From there we build the structure, wireframes and a visual layer consistent with the brand. Every project is tested on a clickable prototype before it reaches developers – so a change costs hours, not weeks of rework.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd__more reveal\"><a class=\"is-lead\" href=\"#ux-research\">Research ↓</a><a href=\"#architecture\">Architecture ↓</a><a href=\"#ui-design\">UI design ↓</a><a href=\"#prototypes\">Prototypes ↓</a><a href=\"#design-system\">Design system ↓</a></div>\n          </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"sd__blk sd__split\" id=\"ux-research\">\n      <div class=\"sd__splitL\"><div class=\"sd__blkh reveal\"><span class=\"sd__kick\"><i></i>01</span><h2>UX research &amp; workshops</h2></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sd__splitR\">\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">We start by talking through goals, audiences and constraints. We look at competitors, the data available and the paths users take today to reach their goal – or where they get lost.</p>\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">The result is a shared picture of what the product should do and for whom, before the first screen is drawn.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd__tags reveal\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><span>Discovery workshops</span><span>Competitor analysis</span><span>Personas</span><span>User journeys</span><span>UX audit</span></div>\n          </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"sd__blk sd__split\" id=\"architecture\">\n      <div class=\"sd__splitL\"><div class=\"sd__blkh reveal\"><span class=\"sd__kick\"><i></i>02</span><h2>Information architecture &amp; wireframes</h2></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sd__splitR\">\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">We organise content and features into a structure that makes sense to the user, not to the company org chart.</p>\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">Wireframes show the layout of key views without colour or imagery, which keeps the conversation on what matters: the order of information and the path to contact.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd__tags reveal\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><span>Sitemap</span><span>Information architecture</span><span>Wireframes</span><span>User scenarios</span></div>\n          </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"sd__blk sd__split\" id=\"ui-design\">\n      <div class=\"sd__splitL\"><div class=\"sd__blkh reveal\"><span class=\"sd__kick\"><i></i>03</span><h2>UI design</h2></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sd__splitR\">\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">We give the interface the character of the brand. Typography, colour, icons and components are designed view by view – for desktop and mobile.</p>\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">Photo, video and graphics are produced by the same team, so the design never waits on material and looks consistent from day one.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd__tags reveal\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><span>UI design</span><span>Responsive design</span><span>Mobile first</span><span>Micro-interactions</span><span>Interface motion</span></div>\n          </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"sd__blk sd__split\" id=\"prototypes\">\n      <div class=\"sd__splitL\"><div class=\"sd__blkh reveal\"><span class=\"sd__kick\"><i></i>04</span><h2>Prototypes &amp; testing</h2></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sd__splitR\">\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">A clickable prototype lets you move through the product as if it were already live. We use it to test navigation, forms and key flows – with the client team and with users.</p>\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">Findings go back into the design before a single line of code is written.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd__tags reveal\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><span>Clickable prototype</span><span>User testing</span><span>A/B testing</span><span>Accessibility (WCAG)</span></div>\n          </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"sd__blk sd__split\" id=\"design-system\">\n      <div class=\"sd__splitL\"><div class=\"sd__blkh reveal\"><span class=\"sd__kick\"><i></i>05</span><h2>Design system &amp; handover</h2></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sd__splitR\">\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">We finish with an organised set of components, styles and rules. Developers build it 1:1, and the client team can grow the product without the look drifting.</p>\n      <p class=\"fmt-p reveal\">We can build it in-house too – as part of our <a href=\"../websites-and-landing-pages/\" style=\"color:var(--fg);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#ffd200;text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:3px\">Websites</a> service.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd__tags reveal\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><span>Component library</span><span>Styles and tokens</span><span>Developer specs</span><span>Build supervision</span></div>\n          </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"sd__blk sd__split\" id=\"sd-proces\">\n      <div class=\"sd__splitL\"><div class=\"sd__blkh reveal\"><h2>How we work</h2></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sd__splitR\">\n      <div class=\"sd__steps\">\n        <div class=\"sd__step reveal\"><h3>Workshop</h3><p>Goal, audience and scope – what the product needs to do.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"sd__step reveal\"><h3>Architecture</h3><p>Content structure and wireframes of key views.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"sd__step reveal\"><h3>UI design</h3><p>Look and feel, components and mobile versions.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"sd__step reveal\"><h3>Prototype</h3><p>A clickable version to validate before build.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"sd__step reveal\"><h3>Handover</h3><p>Design system and files ready for development.</p></div>\n      </div>\n          </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"sd__blk sd__split\" id=\"sd-work\">\n      <div class=\"sd__splitL\"><div class=\"sd__blkh reveal\"><h2>Selected work</h2></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sd__splitR\">\n      <div class=\"sd__work\">\n        <a class=\"sd__wi reveal\" href=\"../../../en/realizacja-primespot/\"><div class=\"sd__wm\"><img src=\"/assets/portfolio/primespot/pjur-blue-wide-2.jpg\" alt=\"PrimeSpot – Landing · Campaign\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><span>Landing · Campaign</span><h3>PrimeSpot ↗</h3></a>\n        <a class=\"sd__wi reveal\" href=\"../../../realizacja-world-of-warships/\"><div class=\"sd__wm\"><img src=\"/assets/work/captains-club-int.avif\" alt=\"World of Warships – Event · Digital\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><span>Event · Digital</span><h3>World of Warships ↗</h3></a>\n        <a class=\"sd__wi reveal\" href=\"../../../en/realizacja-soho-form/\"><div class=\"sd__wm\"><img src=\"/assets/portfolio/soho-form/soho-mockup.webp\" alt=\"Soho Form – UX/UI · Website\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><span>UX/UI · Website</span><h3>Soho Form ↗</h3></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sd__more reveal\">\n        <a class=\"is-lead\" href=\"../../../en/portfolio-en/#pt-grid\">Full portfolio ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"../../../en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid\">Video</a>\n        <a href=\"../../../en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid\">Animation</a>\n        <a href=\"../../../en/portfolio-en/?cat=eventy#pt-grid\">Events</a>\n        <a href=\"../../../en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid\">Graphics</a>\n      </div>\n          </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"sd__blk sd__split\" id=\"sd-faq\">\n      <div class=\"sd__splitL\"><div class=\"sd__blkh reveal\"><h2>FAQ – common questions</h2></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sd__splitR\">\n      <details class=\"sd__g reveal\" open><summary><h3>What is the difference between UX and UI?</h3><span class=\"sd__pm\"></span></summary><div class=\"sd__gin\"><p>UX is the logic of the product: structure, flows and how easily people reach their goal. UI is the layer you see – typography, colour and components. We design both, because one does not work without the other.</p></div></details>\n      <details class=\"sd__g reveal\"><summary><h3>I already have a website. Can it be improved without starting over?</h3><span class=\"sd__pm\"></span></summary><div class=\"sd__gin\"><p>Yes. We start with a UX audit, show where users get lost and design changes in order of impact.</p></div></details>\n      <details class=\"sd__g reveal\"><summary><h3>Which tools do you use?</h3><span class=\"sd__pm\"></span></summary><div class=\"sd__gin\"><p>Figma and the full Adobe Creative Cloud suite – we pick the tool for the task, not the other way round. You get access to the files, the prototype and the design system, with no locked formats.</p></div></details>\n      <details class=\"sd__g reveal\"><summary><h3>Will you build the site you designed?</h3><span class=\"sd__pm\"></span></summary><div class=\"sd__gin\"><p>Yes. Development is done in-house – from WordPress, through React, to any technology the project needs. See our <a href=\"../websites-and-landing-pages/\" style=\"color:var(--fg);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#ffd200;text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:3px\">Websites</a> service.</p></div></details>\n      <details class=\"sd__g reveal\"><summary><h3>How long does a UX/UI project take?</h3><span class=\"sd__pm\"></span></summary><div class=\"sd__gin\"><p>It depends on scope – a landing page is a different scale from a store or an app. We give a timeline and a quote after the brief or a short workshop.</p></div></details>\n          </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"sd__blk sd__split\" id=\"sd-related\">\n      <div class=\"sd__splitL\"><div class=\"sd__blkh reveal\"><h2>See also</h2></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sd__splitR\">\n      <div class=\"svcA\" style=\"margin-top:0\">\n        <a class=\"svcA__row reveal\" href=\"../websites-and-landing-pages/\"><span class=\"svcA__no\">01</span><h3 class=\"svcA__t\">Websites</h3><p class=\"svcA__d\">Development in WordPress, React or any other stack.</p><span class=\"svcA__go\">↗</span></a>\n        <a class=\"svcA__row reveal\" href=\"../graphic-design/\"><span class=\"svcA__no\">02</span><h3 class=\"svcA__t\">Graphic design</h3><p class=\"svcA__d\">Logos, key visuals and advertising material.</p><span class=\"svcA__go\">↗</span></a>\n        <a class=\"svcA__row reveal\" href=\"../visual-identity/\"><span class=\"svcA__no\">03</span><h3 class=\"svcA__t\">Visual identity</h3><p class=\"svcA__d\">The brand system the interface is built on.</p><span class=\"svcA__go\">↗</span></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sub-cta reveal\">\n        <div><h2>Let’s talk about your project.</h2><p>Tell us what you want to build and for whom. We will come back with a proposed scope and timeline.</p></div>\n        <a href=\"../../#kontakt\" class=\"btn btn--primary\"><span class=\"ico\"></span><span class=\"lbl\">Get in touch</span></a>\n      </div>\n          </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>";
---

